{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたらクリスマス終わった。\n季節外れでごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマス♡(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋握手会\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタコス、みんな喜ぶかなあ？\nって思ってしたけど\n喜んでる人少なかった( ꒪⌓꒪)\n悲しい( ꒪⌓꒪)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダルマじゃないよ。\n赤ずきんじゃないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさん( ꒪⌓꒪)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生のちびちゃん2人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生の伊藤さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/26/9302496/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身バージョン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"